window.products.push({"id":339015,"name":"Royal Collection 1800 Split King Thread Count Bamboo Quality Bed Sheet Set with 2 Twin XL Fitted, 1 King Flat and 2 King Pillow Cases. Wrinkle & Shrin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CzakvzF1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Come home to the Ultimate Quality and Luxury of the Super soft Super Cool 1800 Bamboo Quality Sheets. These sheets are designed to make you feel the Luxury. Beautiful Colors. Ultimate Quality. Long Lasting Fabric. Wrinkle Free, Shrinkage Free For life. No Ironing or fabric softener required. 5 pcs sets: 1 Flat Sheet, 2 Fitted Sheets (extra long) and 2 King Size Pillowcases Split King Sheet set with 2 Extra Long Fitted Sheets, 1 King Size Flat Sheet and 2 King Size Pillow Cases. Designed to make you feel Comfort and Luxury at the same time. Made with High Quality Brushed Microfiber Yarns which are Cooler in Summer and Warm in Winter. Care Instructions: Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Tumble dry low. Bamboo Quality Sheets. Customer Testimonials I bought a set of the 1800 count sheets at a show in the convention center a month ago. They were extremely soft and felt like sleeping on butter. I was a bit skeptical at first since I had never bought microfiber sheets before this. But I have to say, these sheets have now replaced even my egyptian cotton set since I don't have to see all those wrinkles on my pillowcases ever again. I just bought my 4th set off the website yesterday. Maria Gutierrez Orlando, FL. Sheets are very soft and durable so far after almost 8 months of use. They have no wrinkles on them out of the dryer as promised by the person at the gift show, so I'm quite happy. I have also found them to be quite cool for summer time, so it's a winner. I have personally always been happy with the sheets. Stefani Perkins, Dallas, TX.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CzakvzF1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Collection 1800","source_asin":"B078YFBCMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078YFBCMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078YFBCMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
