window.products.push({"id":339137,"name":"2Pack Diatomaceous Earth Bath Mat with a Non-Slip Backing Soft Absorbent Bath Diatomite Mat for Bathroom（Grey）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jb+G515+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What is Natural Diatomaceous Earth？ Diatomite is a kind of natural siliceous rocky soil accumulated over millennia in fresh water lakes, with neutral PH value, safe, light and soft texture. It has strong ability in absorbing peculiar smell and moisture due to its porous properties. Our bath mat made from natural diatomite material, so it is pure natural and pollution-free.Diatomite bath mat can absorb all the water from the soles of the feet within seconds. Made of diatomaceous ore, this material is easy to clean and lasts for years. Anti-Slip & Protect The Floor Diatomaceous bath mats are made of non-slip TRP rubber at the bottom, which can clamp tightly to all kinds of floors, including tiles and wood, and can be waterproof and impervious to water for a long time, fully protecting the floor and making it dry without mold. Easy to Clean and No Shedding Anti slip bath mats are made with premium fiber locking technology, the fibers will not shed or come off, The fast-drying nonslip absorbent bath mat can withstand low speed machine and frequent hand washing. For best results, please take care to wash in cold water and lay to dry naturally, do not use chlorine bleach or softener, and do not mix. Not Only Bath Mat You can freely put super absorbent diatomite mat in your bathroom, also suitable for doormat, bedrooms, kid's room, laundry rooms, restaurant, hotel, banquet, wedding party and more. Perfect bathroom gift for friends and family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jb+G515+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topifare","source_asin":"B0B86KP8KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B86KP8KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B86KP8KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
