window.products.push({"id":339547,"name":"Linen Home 500 Thread Count King Pillowcase Set | 100% Long-Staple Cotton Pillow Cases | Luxury Satin King Pillowcases | Soft & Smooth Set of 2 Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510pviH6VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT’S IN THE PACK? King Size Satin Pillowcase Set Of 2 measuring 20” x 40”. WHAT MAKES OUR 100% COTTON PILLOW CASES A BETTER ALTERNATIVE? ● Crafted from premium long-staple cotton, Linen Home’s 500 thread count pillowcase is not only incredibly soft but also highly durable. The sateen weave ensures a smooth finish and exceptional longevity even after extensive wash. ● Satin pillowcase for hair is known for its smooth and silky texture that reduces friction and minimizes tugging on your hair while you sleep. The smooth fabric keeps the wrinkles at bay, and the skin glowing. ● Our cotton pillowcases are perfect for sensitive skin, sourced directly from the cotton plant grown without synthetics and GMOs. They’re certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX & MADE IN GREEN which guarantees our bedding has no nasty chemicals or toxic substances that can cause irritation or allergens. WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT? ● We ONLY use long-staple cotton which is better than short-staple or regular cotton, and produces a softer and smoother surface. The sateen weave adds to the buttery smooth texture, while cotton is naturally cooling and breathable for the best sleeping experience. ● Our relentless obsession with every weave, cut, and sew makes all the difference. The inline stitching on the large pillowcases ensures durability, and the envelope closures help the pillows stay inside the case. The gorgeous hemstitch on the cotton pillowcases makes the seams look neat and prevent them from fraying. ● We make all our products in a factory that’s completely powered by renewable energy sources, such as solar and wind power, thus producing more green energy, reducing environmental impact, and minimizing carbon footprint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510pviH6VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linen Home","source_asin":"B0B4JDL63N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JDL63N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JDL63N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
