window.products.push({"id":339665,"name":"SUBTRACTION Coat Hooks,No Drilling Stainless Steel Wall Mount Coat Hook Rack, Hook Rail Hook Hanger for Coats, Hats, Scarves, Keys,with 4 Dual Hooks,B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612IJq6-pDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GET IT NOW:Keep Your Coats In Order&Make Your Home A New Look. Are you still troubled by your messy home as there is no place to store your coats? Do not want to do damage to your wall by install a tradition wall mount coat hooks? Does your coat hook always rust and dirty your coats or anything you hanging with it? GET IT NOW,AND ALL THESE PROBLEMS WILL BE SOLVED. TWO INSTALLATION METHODS:Suitable for any surface of wall . Install with glue:Apply glue in the back and stick it to the wall,then waiting for 48 hours before use.It is only suitable for the smooth wall and will do no damage to it. Install with screw:Use 6mm drill to drill hole at the wall,then use hammer to hit the plastic wall anchor into the hole,then screw the coat rack onto the wall. According to the type of wall,you could choose any way you like to install this coats rack.There is no difference on performance between installed with screw and installed with glue. IT WILL BE A PITY IF YOU JUST SEE IT AS ONLY A COATS HOOK. Material:304 Type premium grade Stainless Steel.Unlike the plastic one,it has stronger load-bearing capacity(load bear up to 40lbs),more durable and solid.It will never rust and corrode,which means it will never dirty your coats. 11.2”Long:Not so long but so strong!You can mount it in the living room, bathrooms, bedrooms, kitchens, hallways, entryways,also on the back of the door or other small space, saving space for your home.  4 Dual hooks design:You can storage two things in one hook.Which means there are 8 position for you to hang your clothes, hats, umbrellas, bags, 4 larger at the top and 4 smaller down below. Thanks to all these great design,you can install it in any place and for any purpose you like. So What Are You Waiting For?Get It Now!You Will Not Be Disappointed! Add To Cart!Makes Your Home A New Look And Enjoy Your New Life With It!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612IJq6-pDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUBTRACTION","source_asin":"B07VF6PQT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VF6PQT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VF6PQT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
