window.products.push({"id":339679,"name":"Soap Dispenser, Touchless Automatic Soap Dispenser Equipped Stainless Steel Infrared Motion Sensor Waterproof Base Adjustable Switches Suitable for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJHT0qFQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🍯🏠 [ Sensor Soap Dispenser ] Just put your hand under the sensor to start the soap dispenser. You can control the amount of soap by moving your hands. When your hands are away from the sensor, the soap dispensing stops. No water or soap drops. You don’t need to touch the soap dispenser so as to avoiding cross infection effectively. 🍯🏠[ Adjustable Switches ] With a capacity of 250 ml / 8.45 oz and variable distribution control, the volume of soap with the +/- switch allows you to control the volume of liquid released from 0.5 to 3 ml. You can adjust the amount of soap as needed. 🍯🏠 [ Sturdy & Durable ] Made by advanced 304 stainless steel（middle）and ABS plastic material(the top and bottom), durable and rust-proof, superb quality keeps its long-term metallic gloss , it is suitable for any bathroom or kitchen sink countertop, superb quality keeps its long-term metallic gloss.Powered by 4 x AAA batteries (not included). 🍯🏠 [ Full Protection Base ] Designed with a waterproof base and rubber seals to prevent water entering the battery compartment. The automatic soap dispenser is made with high quality waterproof technology in order to protect from drips and corrosion caused by water or soap.In addition, there is no screw for the base easy to separate it. 🍯🏠 [ Works With Any Soap ] Soap dispenser is compatible with all kinds of liquid such as hand sanitizer and hand soap, dish dispenser soap, and it is also suitable for hand or body lotion and disinfectant. Perfect for your bathroom, kitchen, coffee bar, hotel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qJHT0qFQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAYI","source_asin":"B08H4N8W6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4N8W6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4N8W6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
