window.products.push({"id":339793,"name":"Waste-Eze; Adaptive,13 Gallon Kitchen/Office Trash Can, with Ergonomic, Easy-to-Use Design and Made in The U.S.A. - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612k6qPV06L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO USE; The Waste Eze Trash Can is Designed to flex, and function much like an old fashioned clothes pin. But instead of pushing inward, to hold clothes on a line, it pushes out, to hold a trash bag in place. So to install a new trash bag, there's no need to tie knots in the bag or even shake it open. Simply place the bag over the rim, and the adaptive structure of the trash can automatically adjusts to the bag and holds it securely in place. HIGH CAPACITY; Another function of the \"V\" shape design is that it equalizes air pressure,and nearly eliminates the vacuum that forms when a full trash bag is being removed. This feature allows for over-stuffing, and up to a 30% higher bag capacity. EASY TO CLEAN; Yet another advantage of the \"V\" design is that it simplifies the cleaning process. The open sides created by the \"V\" shape allows for easy access to the interior. It also provides plenty of natural ventilation, which gives our trash can the unique ability to dry, even after a new bag is installed. This means you can wash the trash can, then save time by letting it dry while you're using it. USES MOST BRANDS OF TRASH BAGS; Waste-Eze trash cans will adjust to fit most brands of tall kitchen drawstring bags, including Glad, Hefty, Husky, Ace Hardware and Costco's Kirkland brand. GREAT ALTERNATIVE TO STAINLESS STEEL; Our trash cans have no complicated mechanisms to wear out. And they are not susceptible to being dented or marred, which helps to preserve their appearance for years after your purchase. HEAVY GAUGE MATERIAL; Waste-Eze trash cans are made in the U.S.A. to the highest standard. Their heavy gauge construction and flexible, shock absorbing design, make our receptacles very resistant to both wear and impact damage. NOW AVAILABLE IN BLACK; At Waste-Eze, we are looking towards the future of the industry, with both new colors to choose from, and all new designs in development..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612k6qPV06L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waste-Eze","source_asin":"B0BJB59BD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJB59BD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJB59BD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339794,"name":"Espiraio Chair Cushion, Thick and Comfortable Seat Cushion Pads, Super Soft Cute Plush Durable Square Pillow, Shaggy Chair Cover Chair Pads Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ET+jhD18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️『Plush cushion』The fluffy cushion is filled with polyester fiber sponge, which is very soft and comfortable. The surface fluff is made of PV long fleece, which feels very smooth and brings a good relaxing experience to the hips and waist. ✔️『Durable chair cushion』The process design of nine fixed points allows the filling to be fixed and makes the chair cushion more durable. The mat will not flatten over time and can better retain the filling. Espiraio seat cushions have a longer service life than ordinary chair cushions. ✔️『Machine washable』The furry cleaning of our seat cushions is very simple. You only need to wipe it with a wet towel. If you need to machine wash, please put it in a laundry bag and wash separately, and wash in cold water. Use low-temperature drying. ✔️『The Espiraio chair cushion meets all your needs at home』The strapless design allows the seat cushion to be used flexibly in more places: Office, restaurant, game room, baby room, nursery, sofa, bed, relaxation area, outdoor picnic, pet rest. ✔️『Vacuum packaging』In order to prevent the cushion from being damaged and soiled during storage and transportation, we use vacuum packaging, which may cause creases during transportation. After receiving the seat cushion, please lightly tap it to remove the floating hair to avoid sticking to the clothes. The fluffy state can be restored within a few days. ✔️『Unique purpose』The soft cushion can protect your seat from injury. It is not only a luxurious-looking cushion but also can be used as decoration and photographic props. Let luxury, beauty, and comfort come into your life together. \" ✔️『Intimate after-sales service』If you have any questions about the cushion, please feel free to consult us. We will get back to you within 24 hours. Espiraio wishes you a happy shopping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ET+jhD18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Espiraio","source_asin":"B09CJYGQS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CJYGQS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CJYGQS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339795,"name":"Vegetable Peeler By Cestari Kitchen - Pro Peeler with Razor Sharp Ceramic Blade - Lightweight Ergonomic Handle - Package of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-C9bP0X4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This vegetable peeler set enables you to have one peeler for right handers and one for lefties - just flip the blade of one of the two peelers to the left-handed orientation. STAYS SHARP 10x LONGER THAN STEEL: Advanced ceramic blade is harder than steel, never rusts, lasts years longer than stainless or carbon steel peelers. Non-porous, so it won't pick up strong odors or tastes from foods. NO WASTE: Precisely calibrated to remove a thin strip of peel without mangling the fruit or vegetable. The thickness of the peel can be adjusted by the amount of pressure applied. As a carrot peeler, it scrapes off a thin strip of peel, while as a butternut squash peeler, it handily deals with the thicker skin. COMFORTABLE: Perfectly balanced, nonskid ergonomic grip, solid contoured handle designed for controlled peeling EASY CARE AND LIFETIME WARRANTY: Single piece handle has no seams to harbor food particles; dishwasher safe for easy cleaning; Return for replacement at any time, for any reason, no questions asked. BONUS: Receive FREE ebook, \"How to Select Fresh Vegetables,\" with purchase (See ASIN B00KR11L00 for more information on the book)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-C9bP0X4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cestari","source_asin":"B0100DZGZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0100DZGZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0100DZGZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
