window.products.push({"id":339916,"name":"JennyGems Fall in Love Wood Blocks Signs, Fall Decor, Fall Tiered Tray Decor, Fall Mantel Decorations, Tabletop Fall Decorations, Mini Fall Decor, Fal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tq3RPjyuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About: This is a set of 3 mini wooden blocks. Reads \"Fall In Love.\" Each block measures 5.5x2x.75 inches and can be displayed on any flat surface, such as a shelf, desk, dresser, and counter. This block set is made from high quality wood. This wood block set features autumn colors, an easy to read font, and a romantic message of love. Fall Decorations | Autumn Decorations | Fall Home Decor Signs: These amazing blocks are great for decorating your home for the fall season. Their autumn colors and fun friendly casual style will warm up any room. This super cozy set will add warmth & a special touch to your tiered tray centerpiece and fall shelf decor. The warm & friendly shelf sitter set will look adorable on your fireplace mantel. Home Accent | Fall Signs | Farmhouse Fall Decorations: A modern, yet rustic farmhouse home decor style. Whether you are renovating a room or decorating for the fall season, these blocks are perfect for your french country, farmhouse or rustic themed style. Displays nicely in any dining room, coffee table or tabletop in any room, foyer, entryway, living room, or front porch. Don't forget to decorate your office desk for the the fall season, too! Gift Ideas | Small Fall Sign | Fall Table Decorations | Farmhouse Fall Decor: Perfect gift idea for anyone who has an Autumn birthday. This block set also makes a great housewarming gift. Bring as a hostess gift to display with Thanksgiving decorations or Friendsgiving. Present to someone you know purchasing a new home this fall! Use these blocks with fall outside decor as front door decorations within your fall wreath. Bridal Shower Decorations | Fall Wedding Decor: Classy, warm, and rustic fall aesthetic fits in perfectly with table centerpiece decorations or have on display at the dessert table, gifts table, or use as photo props. Perfect fall in home decor for celebrating a special occasion. These wood signs are a great idea for bridal shower favors or wedding favors. Your guests will be falling in love with such a sweet & thoughtful gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tq3RPjyuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JennyGems","source_asin":"B099CKH9R9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099CKH9R9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099CKH9R9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339917,"name":"Silver \"Foil\" Bunny Holding Egg","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HXzzW-6UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cute Easter Bunny decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HXzzW-6UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"K&K Interiors","source_asin":"B00IKL5D94","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IKL5D94","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IKL5D94","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339918,"name":"Braun BNC011WHWH Quartz Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YzZeTAGcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Braun design history Braun GmbH is one of the world's leading manufacturers of small electric appliances. Braun's widely acclaimed reputation for innovative product design goes back to German engineer and inventor Max Braun. From the mid-1950s, the Braun brand was closely linked with the concept of German modern industrial design and its combination of functionality and technology. In 1956, Braun created its first design department, headed by Dr. Fritz Eichler, who instituted a collaboration with the Ulm School of Design to develop a new product line. In 1956 the company introduced its famous SK4 record player ('Snow White's Coffin'), designed by a youthful Dieter Rams together with the pioneer of system design, Hans Gugelot, then lecturer of design at the Ulm School of Design. Rams soon became the most influential designer at Braun. Rams was a key figure in the German design renaissance of the late 1950s and 1960s. Eventually becoming head of Braun's design staff, Rams' influence was soon evidenced in many products. Many of his designs - sleek coffee makers, calculators, radios and razors - have found a permanent home at the Museum of Modern Art. Braun products have been shown more frequently at exhibitions than those of any other comparable company. Some people find that they reflect basic human values such as authenticity and integrity. For others, they are the very incarnation of German perfectionism. Braun is not merely a trademark; it stands for an all-encompassing concept. For the last five decades, this concept has spawned innovative products with an unprecedented regularity that begs to be explained - especially as the era spanned by the history of Braun design is not exactly one characterized by continuity. In 2000, the readers of markt intern, a German trade journal for retailers of electric appliances, voted Braun Germany's number one \"Electro Retail Partner\" ahead of three of its competitors. Apparently, the company's image for superior design and cutting-edge technology was strong enough to carry Braun's success of eighty years over into a new century. Clocks and watches In 1971, Braun launched a series of travel alarm clocks and watches. The infamous German industrial designers, Dieter Rams and Deitrich Lubs were the masterminds behind the project; and, with their “Less, is more” design philosophy they produced a number of memorable products for Braun including some of the best travel alarm clocks around. Over the last 40 years, Braun time pieces were characterized by their pure, highly functional and timeless design with no superfluous details: Every feature directly reflects a function. Rooted in over half a century of modern design at Braun, the core values of functionality, quality and aesthetics are reflected in all clocks and watches. The strength of clarity and simplicity of their design makes them a pleasure to use and to own. The analog clocks were manufactured with the intention to prioritize innovation and durability. The beautifully sleek structure and dial illumination, together with the slight graying back of the numbers ensures that the hour arms are clear and easily readable. All the clocks use precision German movements, known for their silent nature and high accuracy. A variety of models use radio controlled movements for complete accuracy of time. A selection of the very best classic clocks and watches have been recreated in keeping with the high standards of quality of the originals. At the same time, brand new designs on both watches and clocks take the collection further than ever before. It has an pivot alarm system, easy to read dial layout, crescendo alarm and quiet German precision quartz movement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YzZeTAGcL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Braun","source_asin":"B00E0C9TRO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E0C9TRO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E0C9TRO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
