window.products.push({"id":339967,"name":"Privacy Window Films, Translucent Glass Tint Static Cling Treatment Reflects Rainbow Effect with Sunlight - Home Security and Decorative, Heat Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tNlPM-XNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Crystal Mosaic Privacy Window Tint has Magic 3D rainbow effects, Provides Good Privacy, Protects Skin And Eyes, And Prevents Furniture From Fading And Aging By Blocking Out More Than 97% Harmful Rays And Filtering Strong Light. While Show You A Comfortable And Decorative Home Where Has no Disturbance From Dazzling Strong Light And UV Rays When You Are Enjoying The Natural Sunshine! High-performance Vinyl + Super static cling, lasting from 3 to 5 years. Tips: 1, Always put the film on the inside of window and only apply it to smooth glass surfaces. 2, Affix tape on a corner of the back side to quickly remove the clear backing. 3, For best results, do not apply film in direct sunlight or during freezing weather. 4, A helper is especially necessary when applying film to large windows. Having an extra hand will enable you to steady the film and work through issues if they arise. 5, Don't apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. Don't know how to use it? Don't worry, the static cling film is very easy to apply ! Step 1. Keep Window or Glass cleanStep 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water.( Soapy water will be better ) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect film, and then the smooth side should be post to the window. (Please MAKE SURE you have removed protect film before you apply the window film to glass) Step 4. When you install it, Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 6. Much easier than Wall Decals, it's no problem for you. Step 7. Enjoy your works! GENUINE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Contact us anytime via Amazon for a free refund or replacement, no question asked, no return necessary! For any product related questions or concerns, just let us know and we'll endeavor to respond within 24hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tNlPM-XNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jahoot","source_asin":"B0BG8KQK8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8KQK8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8KQK8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339968,"name":"California Design Den - Full Size Sheets Set, Soft 100% Cotton Cooling Sheets Deep Pockets Snug Fit Elastic, 500 Thread Count, 4-Pc Set, Damask Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3U3ni7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOTHING BEATS THE SOFTNESS & SILKINESS OF OUR SHEETS: While many brands make exaggerated claims of egyptian-cotton quality, we deliver 100% authentic cotton that is soft and silky against the skin for a wonderful feeling. Our 500 thread count full size sheet set is adorned with rich, lustrous tuxedo stripes to bring ultimate luxury to your bedroom CLOUD-WEIGHT SHEETS THAT ARE COOL & COMFORTABLE: If you’re a hot, sweaty sleeper, our cotton sheets full size bed set are perfect for you. The all-natural, breathable cotton bed sheets full size set keeps you cool and breezy in hot and humid months and cozy in chilly weather. Seriously, give it a try & feel the difference yourself! INCLUDES A FITTED SHEET THAT PERFECTLY FITS YOUR MATTRESS: Whatever mattress you have at home, our fitted full bed sheets have an all-around elastic to offer a snug fit. You’d also love our head/foot size indicator that will help you make the bed quickly. Our 4-piece full size bed sheets includes 1 flat sheet (84\" W x 96\" L), 1 fitted sheet (54\" W x 75\" L) with 16\" deep pocket and 2 standard/queen pillowcases (21\" W x 32\" L) NO HARMFUL SUBSTANCES IN OUR SHEETS: We hate harmful substances just like you do. Therefore, our sheet sets for full bed are certified as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX&reg so no harmful substances get in the way. If you have sensitive skin or are looking for full sheet set for the gentle skin of your kids, we are your best bet EASY TO WASH & MAINTAIN: No matter how many times you wash our cotton sheets full size set, they don’t shrink or fade. The full sheets sets cotton fabric is super durable and gets softer after every wash, so you can enjoy these sheets for a long time. Make sure you don’t keep them in the dryer for too long and fold immediately to avoid wrinkles","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F3U3ni7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B0BPSWLVPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSWLVPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSWLVPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
