window.products.push({"id":339991,"name":"GumoHK Super Soft Shaggy Rugs Fluffy Carpets, 4x6 Feet, Indoor Modern Plush Area Rugs for Living Room Bedroom Kids Room Nursery Home Decor, Upgrade An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OLmDs2eNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[Ultra-Soft Design]: Like a Cloud The Shaggy area rug comes with velvety feeling surface and a dense sponge layer in the middle that provides next-level coziness as it is very soft to the touch. It’s ideal for keeping your feet warm from cold hardwood floors or for your kids to comfortably lie on it while playing.As it dampens noise and warms up cold bare floors. [Upgraded Area Rug]:The tight weaving process ensures that the shag carpet in this area is not easy to fall off and the edges are not easy to fall apart. The bottom is made of dots and sponge bottom close together perfectly fit the floor and the carpet without any sliding, In addition to decorating the home can also be very good for the fuzzy rug to keep warm. [Family Preferred]: Our shaggy rugs come in various sizes and colors These fluffy rugs work great in bedrooms, offices, living rooms, children’s rooms or dressing rooms. so you can choose the one that perfectly fits your space and complements your decor. The plush rugs can be a solution for every space.or every space.Effortlessly give your room a designer look without the designer cost. [Easy to Clean]:We recommend to vacuum the rug regularly to reduce potential sheds and dust, you can hand wash the dirty area without worrying about color fade.If use a washing machine, please put it in a laundry bag. After washing, please fully air dry the rugs, to ensure the fluffy area rug. We recommend washing your rug separately. [Warm Tips]:In order to make transportation convenient, our carpet packaging is well folded and compressed, so when you unpack the package, it will be a little thinner than the original thickness, but because of the ultimate softness, it will return to normal after 3-5 days.If any question occurs about the quality, please don’t hesitate to turn to our customer service for help, we will give you a satisfactory solution in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OLmDs2eNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GumoHK","source_asin":"B0BNZ4Q67B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZ4Q67B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZ4Q67B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":339992,"name":"Skandinavisk JUL 'Christmas' Scented Candle. Fragrance Notes: Baked Gingerbread, Winter Cloves and Spiced Oranges. 3.17 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mbAAO9iRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Skandinavisk we tell fragrance stories from Scandinavia that are designed to leave a lighter footprint. Our candles are a blend of perfume and Swedish rapeseed wax that is sustainably farmed, traceable and non-GMO. The wax is poured into painted glass votives from metals-free water dyes, with a pure cotton wick and engraved, FSC-certified beechwood lid. Our packaging card is FSC-certified and comes from managed Swedish forests. To scent a room, we recommend you burn the candle for no longer than 3 hours at a time, or until the melt pool reaches the glass edge. Let the wax cool and trim the wick to 0.5cm before relighting. Always leave 0.5cm of unmolten wax at the base of the candle to prevent prolonged exposure of direct heat to the glass and surface below. The beechwood lids are designed to be used as a protective base for the lit candle, and as a snuffer to extinguish the flame. When the wax is finished, wash and reuse the glass for tealights or storage, or sort and recycle after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mbAAO9iRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skandinavisk","source_asin":"B0B8NP2JFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-339992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NP2JFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NP2JFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
